(text "J1 is the existing barrel jack on buck U1.\nJ103 VIN pins feed J104.9/10 and both TMC power headers.\nDedicated underside supply/return branches; common 0 V.\nBuck +5 V powers the DM542T signals and encoder circuit only." (at 20.32 114.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "878e17ef-087e-5020-b4c4-1e7c2b078f0f"))
(symbol (lib_id "ProtoMate:Arduino_GIGA_R1_WiFi") (at 285.75 132.08 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board no) (dnp no) (uuid "afdb44da-697f-5b52-9f0a-d104ac82196d") (property "Reference" "A1" (at 285.75 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Value" "Arduino GIGA R1 WiFi / ABX00063" (at 285.75 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Footprint" "" (at 285.75 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))) (instances (project "ProtoMate" (path "/c8cc4ec5-2ec6-5eef-bd6d-1c97d70567a6" (reference "A1") (unit 1)))))
(text "GIGA POWER / LOGIC\nPower the GIGA independently through USB-C.\nGIGA 3V3 -> J101.8; GIGA GND -> common logic return.\nDo not connect buck +5 V to GIGA 5V, VIN or USB.\nNo 24 V or 5 V on any GIGA signal input.\nUse Arduino D/A labels, not connector ordinal numbers.\nThe GIGA has its own 16 MHz crystal; no ST-Link clock feed." (at 20.32 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e5e7b91d-1738-5027-ae0b-7ef0a285cd9d"))
(text "M4 MOTOR PERIPHERALS\nTIM2 CH1/3/4: A7/PA0, D3/PA2, D2/PA3.\nTIM3 encoder: D7/PB4, D5/PA7; index D53/PG7.\nR7 biases shared enable HIGH (disabled) during reset.\nR1/R2, R8 and R9 bias STEP LOW.\nQSPI and filesystem storage are handled by the GIGA;\nno external flash or SD wiring is part of this perfboard." (at 20.32 170.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7942897a-c057-5c70-bd8f-20bde05d3663"))
