(text "Shared names connect across sheets. A1 numbers are Arduino D/A/power labels; J101-J111/J113 are perfboard contacts.\nREF inputs: internal 3.3 V pull-ups, both-edge EXTI; NC to GND. Released = LOW; pressed / unplugged = HIGH.\nU1/A3/A4 mount at J103/J105/J106. Buck VIN distributes 24 V. TMC JP1.6/5: power headers; JP1.4-1: motor terminals." (at 20.32 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ccdd8e42-53c1-57b3-8594-c37268f31feb"))
